---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Ethos | Pine Lake Covenant Church">
  <div class="canvas ethos">
    <header class="section page-intro ethos__header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="display">Our Ethos</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        At Pine Lake, we try to keep things simple. Our life together as a church is shaped by three core ideas:
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section ethos__core" aria-label="Core ideas">
      <ul class="ethos__pillars" role="list">
        <li><strong>Be with Jesus</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Become like Jesus</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Do what Jesus did</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-body-large">
        These guide how we follow Jesus, how we grow together, and how we seek to love and serve our community.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section ethos__beliefs">
      <p class="eyebrow">Convictions</p>
      <h2>What we believe</h2>

      <div class="belief-grid">
        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span> the <span class="belief-key">Bible</span> is a trustworthy guide for
          understanding
          <span class="belief-key">God</span> and learning how to live.
        </p>

        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span> following <span class="belief-key">Jesus</span> is more than adopting
          a set of ideas: it’s about a real change of heart and direction.
        </p>

        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span> the <span class="belief-key">Church</span> exists not just for itself,
          but to love, serve, and share hope with the world.
        </p>

        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span>
          <span class="belief-key">faith</span> is meant to be lived in <span class="belief-key">community</span>, where
          people support one another and grow together.
        </p>

        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span>
          <span class="belief-key">God</span> is present and active today through the <span class="belief-key"
            >Holy Spirit</span
          >, guiding, shaping, and empowering us.
        </p>

        <p class="belief-statement">
          <span class="belief-lead">We believe</span> the <span class="belief-key">Good News of the Gospel</span>
          brings freedom from shame and fear, and offers grace for our failings.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
